{"steam_appid":2764750,"steam_name":"The Other Side","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2764750/190659077/70ea23eb1a37a4602b19e0646b880dd6d667e231/1776740262/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776740804","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257323195/535911149f60b2a3a3135d3cd4af99954f7fb64a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776740804","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/8ac131839544cbd57af910ec5551c5e6a3245864/ss_8ac131839544cbd57af910ec5551c5e6a3245864.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776740807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/24577836742711029998b087ad6c0bffbab28c44/ss_24577836742711029998b087ad6c0bffbab28c44.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776740807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/943aba3c93e2c6a1d789001c63f66d224f257c00/ss_943aba3c93e2c6a1d789001c63f66d224f257c00.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776740807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/1b5fdc731481cd86eebd48b960884726e7e648db/ss_1b5fdc731481cd86eebd48b960884726e7e648db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776740807","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/f1dbfb789513de150239f195657b00d4d3ec7538/ss_f1dbfb789513de150239f195657b00d4d3ec7538.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776740807"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/609fb4e92a660b2455bd8bd91e01a304.poster.avif?t=1776740807\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/609fb4e92a660b2455bd8bd91e01a304.webm?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/609fb4e92a660b2455bd8bd91e01a304.mp4?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/5d12bb967ba0bbcc000d005cda9a025c.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/a400525afbd4bb47c6d851a745d3384a.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Other Side is a 1-6 player cooperative paranormal investigation game. Players work together to identify and cleanse entities using a range of equipment, and environmental tools. Gather evidence, track ghost behavior, and complete objectives across different locations using both traditional, and modernized tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can customize their characters and unlock items to personalize their headquarters. Built in Unreal Engine 5, the game focuses on modern, functional investigation systems and detailed environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/5d12bb967ba0bbcc000d005cda9a025c.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/064ee2a5c3915d14805c867e81165546.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, or with up to five other players as you investigate haunted locations. Work together to identify and cleanse entities by gathering evidence and completing objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Voice Chat:</strong><br>Communicate with your team using proximity-based voice chat. Share information, coordinate movement, and respond to events in real time. Players can even communicate with their fallen friends by using the spirit box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Equipment:</strong> <br>Players can bring and use equipment during contracts, allowing teams to coordinate loadouts and approach each investigation strategically. Success depends on how effectively tools are used, and information is shared.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/5d12bb967ba0bbcc000d005cda9a025c.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/69ee9afb4aa4428e94bf30867a651d69.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game to unlock more customization options across your loadout, character, and headquarters. Earn money via contracts to spend on customization options for yourself, your vehicle, and headquarters. Upgrading to a larger vehicle increases the number of items you can bring into investigations. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/f346db47eec511f98efa326656dfb935.poster.avif?t=1776740807\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/f346db47eec511f98efa326656dfb935.webm?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/f346db47eec511f98efa326656dfb935.mp4?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization:</strong> <br>Customize your character with a range of apparel, hairstyles, and skin tones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/0231f970d7d2ce14fff590d7b2e1cda8.poster.avif?t=1776740807\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/0231f970d7d2ce14fff590d7b2e1cda8.webm?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/0231f970d7d2ce14fff590d7b2e1cda8.mp4?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Headquarters Outfitting:</strong><br>Unleash your creativity as you furnish and upgrade your base, sculpting its appearance to reflect your success in completing contracts and tasks. Create an atmospheric hub that fellow ghost hunters envy.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/351b0c441ed720187c9dfb56bfb34fa7.poster.avif?t=1776740807\" width=600 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/351b0c441ed720187c9dfb56bfb34fa7.webm?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/351b0c441ed720187c9dfb56bfb34fa7.mp4?t=1776740807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/5d12bb967ba0bbcc000d005cda9a025c.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/e401baa1016da102b6f821f3fe36bb1c.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Identify</strong>:<br>Determine the ghost type by gathering evidence, and observing behavior. Use investigation tools to track activity, collect date, and correctly identify the ghost haunting the location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cleanse</strong>:<br>Now that the Identify Team has done their job, it's time for you to do yours. Work as a team to cleanse the location of the ghost haunting it. Use your ghost-hunting tools to identify the ghost's characteristics, and input them into the Spectral Affixer, revealing the location of the artifacts binding the ghost to the location. Find the artifacts and destroy them to banish the ghost from the location.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/5d12bb967ba0bbcc000d005cda9a025c.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=5 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2764750/extras/107151c9e49c0149b3bf901abf24c751.webp?t=1776740807\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate a range of locations, each with distinct layouts, environmental details, and each with their own gameplay challenges. Every location is designed to support evidence gathering, ghost tracking, and contract objectives.</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or new-gen i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 or AMD equivalent (AMD FX 9500+ Series)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660S<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy","Early Access"],"developers":["Vectora Games"],"publishers":["Vectora Games"],"release_date":"Mar 7, 2025"}